    "originalFile": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-04-14</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 10pt;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 5px 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .header-meta {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-top: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .main-content {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .main-content {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .column {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .column-header {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 11pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding-bottom: 8px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 10pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin: 2px;\n            font-size: 7pt;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .source-badge {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            padding-left: 10px;\n            border-left: 2px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .update-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            font-size: 7pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            font-size: 7pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.opinion {\n            background-color: #e8f4f8;\n            color: #2c5282;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.tutorial {\n            background-color: #f0fff4;\n            color: #276749;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.technical {\n            background-color: #fffaf0;\n            color: #9c4221;\n        }\n\n        .author {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .topics {\n            margin-top: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .topic-tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 1px 5px;\n            font-size: 7pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin: 2px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 15px 10px;\n            text-align: center;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .stats {\n            display: inline-block;\n            margin: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .highlight {\n            background-color: #ffffd0;\n            padding: 0 2px;\n        }\n\n        .github-stars {\n            color: #ff6600;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .product-hunt-points {\n            color: #ff6600;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"header-meta\">\n                <span id=\"report-date\">2026-04-14</span> |\n                <span>Daily Updates in AI-Powered Development Tools</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"main-content\">\n            <!-- New Products Column (40%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\">\n                <h2 class=\"column-header\">New Products</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent\" target=\"_blank\">hermes-agent</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Self-improving AI coding agent with closed learning loop that grows with usage. Features TUI interface, multi-platform support (Telegram, Discord, Slack), scheduled automations, and creates skills from experience.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"github-stars\">61.9k GitHub stars (#7 globally)</span> |\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Gained over 6,000+ stars in a single week during April 2026\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Self-improving</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/superhq\" target=\"_blank\">SuperHQ</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Run AI coding agents in real microVM sandboxes for secure, isolated execution environments. Provides 81-point score on Product Hunt and enables safe agent execution.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"product-hunt-points\">81 Product Hunt points</span> |\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Infrastructure</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Security</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">MicroVM</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/open-comet\" target=\"_blank\">Open Comet</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Autonomous AI browser agent for deep research and tasks. Navigates websites autonomously, clicks around, and handles research tasks. Positioned as \"Your browser just got an intern\".\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span> |\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GrowthPigeon</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Your browser just got an intern\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Browser Agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Research</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Automation</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/multica-ai/multica\" target=\"_blank\">multica</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Open-source managed agents platform that turns coding agents into real teammates. Features task assignment, autonomous execution tracking, reusable skills, unified runtimes, and multi-workspace support.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"github-stars\">4,000+ GitHub stars in &lt;1 week</span> |\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Someone just created the open-source version of Claude Managed Agents\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Agent Platform</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Team Management</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Open Source</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/thedotmack/claude-mem\" target=\"_blank\">claude-mem</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Claude Code plugin that automatically captures everything Claude does during coding sessions. Features persistent memory compression, 5 lifecycle hooks, MCP tools, SQLite + Chroma vector DB storage, and progressive disclosure.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub</span> |\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Medium</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"The plugin that turns Claude into a teammate\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Memory Plugin</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Vector DB</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Claude Code</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Column (35%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\">\n                <h2 class=\"column-header\">Whitelist Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-badge\">Feature Release</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://codeium.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf v1.5.9</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Released version 1.5.9 with Gemini 2.5 Pro (Beta) support and fixes for Remote-SSH extension. Recent releases also include new Windsurf Tab experience, context improvements, Cascade auto-linter, and MCP server integration.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>📅 2025-03-25</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Gemini 2.5 Pro</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Remote-SSH</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">MCP</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-badge\">Feature Release</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider/releases\" target=\"_blank\">Aider v0.86.0</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added support for all GPT-5 models and Grok-4 via xAI and OpenRouter. Recent versions (0.83.0-0.86.0) added support for Gemini 2.5 Pro, DeepSeek V3, new /context command, co-authored-by attribution, and 130 new languages with linter support.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>📅 2025-04-14</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">GPT-5</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Grok-4</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">DeepSeek V3</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Multi-language</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-badge\">Minor Release</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/releases\" target=\"_blank\">Continue v1.3.38</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Released v1.3.38-vscode with config.yaml fixes, session history filtering by workspace directory, and .continue/configs support. Recent updates include ClawRouter provider for cost-optimized routing, JetBrains remote config sync improvements, and Gemini 3 tool support.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>📅 2025-04-14</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Config</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ClawRouter</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Gemini 3</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">JetBrains</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Column (25%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\">\n                <h2 class=\"column-header\">Technical Insights</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">LLMs and the Peril of Laziness Lost</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Bryan Cantrill argues that LLMs inherently lack the virtue of laziness - work costs nothing to an LLM, so they don't optimize for future time or develop crisp abstractions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Bryan Cantrill</span> | 📅 2026-04-13\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">ai-assisted-programming</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">llms</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type tutorial\">Tutorial</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemma 4 E2B Audio Transcription</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Simon shared a recipe for transcribing audio files on macOS using the 10.28GB Gemma 4 E2B model with MLX and mlx-vlm.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> | 📅 2026-04-12\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">gemma</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">mlx</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">speech-to-text</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Growing Gap in AI Capability Understanding</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Andrej Karpathy tweeted about the growing gap in understanding of AI capability based on access points and domains.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Andrej Karpathy</span> | 📅 2026-04-10\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">openai</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">chatgpt</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">llms</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://medium.com/neuralnotions/andrej-karpathy-stopped-using-ai-to-write-code-hes-using-it-to-build-a-second-brain-instead-cddceadc5df5\" target=\"_blank\">Karpathy's Shift from AI Coding to Second Brain</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Andrej Karpathy reportedly stopped using AI to write code and is instead focusing on using LLMs to build a 'Second Brain' - a personal knowledge base system.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Andrej Karpathy</span> | 📅 2026-04-11\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">llm</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">knowledge-base</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">personal-ai</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://thenewstack.io/karpathy-says-developers-have-ai-psychosis-everyone-else-is-next/\" target=\"_blank\">Karpathy's 'AI Psychosis' Warning</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Andrej Karpathy warned about 'AI psychosis' among developers, saying he 'started to lose his ability to code' due to over-reliance on AI programming tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Andrej Karpathy</span> | 📅 2026-04-11\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">ai-assisted-programming</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">developer-tools</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">code-atrophy</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta's Muse Spark Model Launch</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Meta announced Muse Spark, their first model release since Llama 4 almost exactly a year ago. Features interesting tool capabilities and reasoning features.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> | 📅 2026-04-08\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">llm-release</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">meta</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">llm-tool-use</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"it